actually, it was my fault for breaking that wand of invisibility. my pet 
Bandersnatch became invisible and killed every shopkeeper and a 
non-aligned priest in Gnometown. it was freaky; a little like being 
followed around by a friendly monster of the Id from "Forbidden Planet". 
"No, don't kill him, i want to sell him some books - oh well."

while i'm having fun summoning things (wand of create monster, woohoo), 
killing them and sacrificing them on the converted altar, one of those 
things reads a cursed scroll of create monster. the tiny room is filled 
with orcs, ants, hyenae and a dog, whom i befriend with a tasty scrap. 
once my team has dealt with the incursion, i zap doggie with the wand of 
polymorph. zap - a Stalker.

great. now i've got two pets that i have to wear my blindfold simply to 
avoid walking into.


